<h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated: October 30, 2026</strong></p>
<p>By accessing or using Trust-Mine, you agree to follow these Terms &amp; Conditions. Please read them carefully before using the platform.</p>

<h2>Platform Use</h2>
<p>Users must use the platform lawfully and respectfully. You must not attempt to disrupt the website, misuse its features, access another person's account or submit misleading information.</p>

<h2>Account Responsibility</h2>
<p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for activity carried out through your account. Please notify support if you notice suspicious activity.</p>

<h2>Educational Information</h2>
<p>Educational materials and general information are provided for learning and informational purposes. They should not be treated as personalised financial, legal or professional advice. Users are responsible for evaluating information before acting on it.</p>

<h2>Packages and Transactions</h2>
<p>Where packages or payment-related features are offered, their descriptions, prices and applicable conditions should be reviewed before confirming a transaction. No guaranteed income, profit or financial return is promised unless expressly stated in a valid written agreement.</p>

<h2>Service Availability</h2>
<p>We may update, maintain or modify platform features when reasonably necessary. We will aim to communicate significant changes through appropriate website or account notices.</p>

<h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
<p>These terms may be revised from time to time. Continued use of the platform after an update means you accept the revised terms.</p>
